                <pb facs="0968" n="888" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg888"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Merry to
                        President Zelaya.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">San
                                José</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1902-08-31"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 31,
                    1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Telegram received. Will immediately address Secretary of State, Washington, in
                    relation thereto. Will write particulars by next mail via Corinto.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Merry.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
